---
const {title='Garden — 식물 관리 도감', description='빛, 물, 흙, 문제 해결을 구조화한 Botanical Journal', canonical, jsonLd} = Astro.props;
const url = canonical ?? new URL(Astro.url.pathname, 'https://garden.emfls.com').href;
---
<!doctype html><html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"><title>{title}</title><meta name="description" content={description}><link rel="canonical" href={url}><meta property="og:title" content={title}><meta property="og:description" content={description}><meta property="og:url" content={url}><meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary"><meta name="theme-color" content="#f4f0e6"><link rel="icon" href="data:,">{jsonLd && <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(jsonLd)} />}</head><body><a class="skip" href="#main">본문으로 건너뛰기</a><header><a class="brand" href="/">GARDEN <small>BOTANICAL JOURNAL</small></a><nav aria-label="주요 메뉴"><a href="/plants/">식물 도감</a><a href="/guides/">관리 가이드</a><a href="/problems/">문제 해결</a><a href="/tools/plant-finder/">Finder</a></nav></header><main id="main"><slot /></main><footer><p>Garden은 식물 관리 정보를 보수적으로 정리하는 편집형 도감입니다.</p><nav><a href="/about/">About</a><a href="/editorial-policy/">Editorial Policy</a><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a><a href="/contact/">Contact</a></nav></footer></body></html>
<style is:global>
:root{--paper:#f4f0e6;--ink:#1d2b21;--green:#365b43;--line:#b9b8a6;--serif:Georgia,serif;--sans:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif}*{box-sizing:border-box}html{background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--sans);line-height:1.65}body{margin:0}a{color:inherit;text-decoration-thickness:.08em;text-underline-offset:.2em}.skip{position:absolute;left:-999px}.skip:focus{left:1rem;top:1rem;background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);padding:.6rem;z-index:5}header,main,footer{max-width:1180px;margin:auto;padding:1.25rem}header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);gap:1rem}.brand{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.4rem;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:.08em}.brand small{display:block;font:10px monospace;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--green)}nav{display:flex;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap}nav a{font-size:.9rem}main{min-height:70vh}footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:.85rem;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem}.eyebrow{font:11px monospace;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--green)}h1,h2,h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:500;line-height:1.15}h1{font-size:clamp(2.5rem,8vw,6.5rem);max-width:850px}.lede{font-size:1.2rem;max-width:600px}.hero{padding:5rem 0 4rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:1rem}.specimen{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:1.25rem;min-height:210px}.specimen h3{margin:.4rem 0;font-size:1.5rem}.meta{font:11px monospace;color:var(--green)}.button{display:inline-block;border:1px solid var(--ink);padding:.65rem 1rem;text-decoration:none;margin-top:1rem}.facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr));border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);margin:2rem 0}.facts div{padding:1rem;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}dt{font:10px monospace;color:var(--green)}dd{margin:.3rem 0;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.2rem}.article{max-width:720px}form{display:grid;gap:1rem;max-width:650px}label{display:grid;gap:.35rem;font-weight:600}select,button{font:inherit;padding:.7rem;border:1px solid var(--ink);background:transparent}button{cursor:pointer;background:var(--green);color:var(--paper)}.result{margin-top:2rem;padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--line)}@media(max-width:600px){header{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}header nav{gap:.65rem}footer{display:block}.hero{padding:3rem 0}h1{font-size:3rem}.facts div{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{scroll-behavior:auto!important;transition:none!important}}
</style>
